name customdice
category Package
revision 64089
shortdesc Simple commands for drawing customisable dice
longdesc The customdice package for LaTeX, LuaLaTeX and XeTeX that
longdesc provides functionality for drawing dice. The aim is to provide
longdesc highly-customisable but simple-to-use commands, allowing:
longdesc adding custom text to dice faces; control over colouring;
longdesc control over sizing.
